   "key": "§ HRV reference data > Three things the first version of this got wrong",
   "hash": "639fc7704b8f63a7",
   "does": "Documents three reference mistakes: SDNN uses N-1; computeTimeDomain filters ectopics so the test compares unfiltered reference against rmssd(fromCleanRRs:) and asserts filtered RMSSD <= raw; mean HR comes from rolling 10-second windows so the test asserts agreement in scale. Verified: tests at :127, :148 and :196 (tolerance max(2.0, 5%)); computeHRStatistics uses stored sensor HR first, then rolling-window HR, then meanRR fallback (TimeDomainAnalysis.swift:339-352).",
